-- -------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- Item proc wiring for the Cataclysm high-end catalogue -- 468 items
-- -------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- Writes spellid_1..5 and their trigger / charges / cooldown / category columns
-- for every high-end item that carries an on-use or on-equip effect.
--
-- APPLY 06_cata_highend_proc_spells.sql FIRST. Every spell referenced below is
-- either minted there or already resolves in stock Spell.dbc -- an item pointing
-- at a missing spell warns at boot.
--
-- 1 spell reference(s) were deliberately zeroed because the spell has no effect
-- data in the 4.3.4 client and so cannot be minted at all:
--     item 70143 slot 2 -> spell 108819
-- Those items keep every other column and simply carry no proc.
--
-- Cooldown columns use -1, not 0, where there is no spell: 0 means "no cooldown"
-- in item_template while -1 means "unset", which is what stock rows carry.
--
-- Idempotent. UPDATE only.
-- -------------------------------------------------------------------------

